==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From the same Proto-Uralic root ''[[Appendix:Proto-Uralic root *kole|*kole]]'' as Hungarian [[hal]].

===Verb===
'''kuolla'''
#to [[die]]:
#:Isoäitini ''kuoli'' syöpä'''''än''''' (= ''illative case''). My grand-mother died of cancer.

